# Derived search indices. Built, never committed.
#
# When these covered only the 3,179-image test split they were ~35MB and
# committing them was a defensible convenience. Indexing the full 31,783
# -image corpus takes the directory to 234MB, and text_index.faiss alone
# is 155MB — above GitHub's 100MB hard limit, so this is no longer a
# tradeoff to weigh.
#
# Rebuild in ~10 minutes on a GPU:
#   python -m backend.index_builder #       --checkpoint checkpoints/train/best_model.pt --split all
backend/indices/

